# Production build config.
#
# The hosted site is served from S3/CloudFront, where the API lives under /api on
# the SAME CloudFront domain (a CloudFront Function strips the prefix before the
# request reaches Lambda — see infra/). So the SPA calls the API same-origin at
# /api, with no separate API host and no CORS.
# (See frontend/src/api/client.ts — the `?? 'http://localhost:8000'` fallback
# only applies when the var is undefined, so this value is used as-is.)
VITE_API_URL=/api
